            "text": "Tunisian simple stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Each row has a forward pass loading loops and a return pass working them off. The fabric surface looks like a woven grid and lies flat without curling when blocked."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A Tunisian hook or a standard hook with an extension cable is needed to hold all loops for a 75 cm wide piece. Aran weight on a 5 mm hook. Total yardage is around 700 g. Tunisian fabric uses more yarn than regular crochet because the stitch is denser."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
