            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ch: chain (foundation)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "tss: Tunisian simple stitch (forward pass: pick up vertical bars; return: work off 2 at a time)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tunisian-cast-on"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Tunisian cast-on"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": chain 105. Forward pass row 0: insert hook under the back bump of each chain, pull up a loop. (105 loops on hook.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Return pass row 0: yarn over, draw through 1 loop. *Yarn over, draw through 2 loops*. Repeat until 1 loop remains."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rows 1 onward"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Forward pass: insert hook under each vertical bar from right to left, pull up a loop. (105 loops on hook.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Return pass: yarn over, draw through 1, *yarn over, draw through 2*. Repeat. (1 loop remains.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat forward and return passes until piece measures 90 cm (approximately 108 rows). Work a final row of sl st across all vertical bars to cast off. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tunisian fabric curls at the edges until blocked. Wet-block firmly: submerge in cool water, pin to the stated dimensions, and allow to dry completely. Secure tails with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "weaving-in-ends"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "weaving in ends"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Handwash cool. Pin flat while damp each time. Tunisian fabric can revert to curling if it dries in a heap."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Tunisian knit stitch blanket produces a fabric that looks like stocking stitch knitting. Or try the waistcoat stitch throw for a knit-look in regular crochet without the long hook."
          }
        ]
      }
